  "title": "UI: Fix data size formatting to use SI quantifiers, also set 0 precision",
  "description": "Fixes the `formattedDataSize()` parameters, see the Qt documentation: https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qlocale.html#formattedDataSize\n\nAlso suggests that `precision = 0` is used (instead of the currently shown 3 or Qt default 2) to provide more clear output, example with this fix:\n\n![image](/uploads/d0572980d3fa5d59656c567d1ab7fafe/image.png)\n\nFixes #18212.\n\nSee also conversation in #18208",
